{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon","id":1061731,"title":"Something strange about Pantechnicon...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-12T22:49:04-07:00","id":1061731,"title":"Something strange about Pantechnicon...","content":"Riddle me this Awakened Community: Who is the Patron Exarch of the Ministry of Pantechnicon, the Seers of the Throne Ministry formed by the Nameless Alliance Mages who accepted the Hegemonic's offer to join the Throne and enforce the Lie through technocracy instead of forming the Free Council like a majority of the rest?<br /> <br /> Because it seems that there are conflicting accounts from different supplements.<br /> <br /> Seers of the Throne says that the Hegemonic's, servants of the Unity, were the ones to found the Ministry. But in that same breath the book also says in Panopticon's write up that Pantechnicon served the Eye and that they were rivals who could grow to replace them.<br /> <br /> And then there's Imperial Mysteries that flat out states that Pantechnicon's Patron Exarch is the Chancellor in the Shadow of the Chancellor's write up but delves no further than that. <br /> <br /> So, is this counter information on purpose? Or is there a definitive answer out there and I'm just remembering it incorrectly. Or, is this like VII from VtR where ultimately the answer is up to the Story Teller?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T23:20:00-07:00","id":1061736,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/new-order/\" target=\"_blank\">This is an old post</a>, though more recent than those books. Down in the comments Dave Brookshaw seems to say they're servants of the Chancellor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T01:28:01-07:00","id":1061760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon#post1061731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seers of the Throne says that the Hegemonic's, servants of the Unity, were the ones to found the Ministry. But in that same breath the book also says in Panopticon's write up that Pantechnicon served the Eye and that they were rivals who could grow to replace them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where is that? I can't find it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T01:50:05-07:00","id":1061761,"title":"","content":"I believe it was in the Ministry of Hegemony and Ministry of Panopticon write up in Seers of the Throne. The former states that it was the Hegemonic's idea to invite the Nameless Alliance to join the Seers and their Great Refusal was so devastating that Hegemony never fully recovered and that it was the start of their decline as a Greater Ministry. The later is a very short segment in the Panopticon write up where they say Pantechnicon is a contender for Panopticon's position and that Panopticon plans to take over the Lesser Ministry from within and subsume it into itself ultimately.<br /> <br /> However, since David already made comments regarding the statement in Imperial Mysteries being the official statement then I have my answer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Polish 03-13-2017, 04:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T03:43:12-07:00","id":1061773,"title":"","content":"Pantechnicon are based on oppression through making the masses reliant on technology they cannot maintain or control - they're the assholes patenting drugs, walled-gardening devices, and putting the interests of a few creators ahead of the populace. That's the Chancellor's symbology.<br /> <br /> Part of their problem is that Mammon, the Ministry of making people only care about the material, is <i>also</i> the Chancellor's symbology, and the Exarch appears to prefer Mammon. As much as the Exarch appears to prefer anything. How much of Mammon's success compared to them is because Pantechnicon have every Libertine in the world having a hate-boner for them specifically versus how much is Exachal favor (and really, to Seer philosophers, how capable human minds are of telling the two apart!) is a grey area.<br /> <br /> If the two Matter Ministries could sort themselves out, they'd almost certainly replace one of the existing Greater ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T07:15:57-07:00","id":1061811,"title":"","content":"Could? Are the Pantechs still around?<br /> <br /> Also, it's a weird thing to feel one's own profession as a tool of the Seers. Hm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T10:34:52-07:00","id":1061875,"title":"","content":"Oh, yeah - Pantechnicon are still active. Don't know where you got the impression they weren't.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind that I worked for a bank for five years, and then at a mobile phone provider for eight. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Everyone's a tool of the Seers in some way. It's the Lie for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T10:47:18-07:00","id":1061879,"title":"","content":"Oh my goodness, thank you so much Dave for that insight into not just Pantechnicon's set up but also some delightful Seer politics. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'd imagine that the other Greater Ministries spend no small about of resources and time just making sure Mammon and Pantechnicon don't get their collective houses in order, especially Hegemony since they're hurting the most in the current era...and now that I think about it because the whole division through waring factions thing is super symbolism for the Unity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 03-13-2017, 01:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T10:52:20-07:00","id":1061884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061875#post1061875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, yeah - Pantechnicon are still active. Don't know where you got the impression they weren't.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind that I worked for a bank for five years, and then at a mobile phone provider for eight. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Everyone's a tool of the Seers in some way. It's the Lie for you.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200bSo as a network engineer I am just a pawn of the Seers? Oh well the pay is good.<br /> <br /> I can see them dominating in Silicone Valley, and they probably run Microsoft, Verizon and Walmart. I knew they were evil but Walmart?<br /> <br /> Next thing you will be telling us is that they are lawyers also.<br /> <br /> LOL, thanks for the info.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T11:15:50-07:00","id":1061889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061884#post1061884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Next thing you will be telling us is that they are lawyers also.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like a Hegemony character concept to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T11:24:51-07:00","id":1061891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RomulusGloriosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061889#post1061889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sounds like a Hegemony character concept to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends what you're doing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T11:59:12-07:00","id":1061901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061884#post1061884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Next thing you will be telling us is that they are lawyers also.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>As an attorney, I, for one, welcome our Seer overlords and their ample billing opportunities.<br /> <br /> Although the Hegemonic Ministry and the Ministry of Mammon generate more billable hours, Pantechnicon certainly provides interesting work, particularly in the field of intellectual property.<br /> <br /> In fact, I would hardly be surprised if the managing partners at many large international law firms here in NYC are loyal Prelates of the Chancellor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","user":"branford","date":". 03-13-2017, 03:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T12:17:47-07:00","id":1061912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061901#post1061901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As an attorney, I, for one, welcome our Seer overlords and their ample billing opportunities.<br /> <br /> Although the Hegemonic Ministry and the Ministry of Mammon generate more billable hours, Pantechnicon certainly provides interesting work, particularly in the fields of intellectual property.<br /> <br /> In fact, I would hardly be surprised if the managing partners at many large international law firms here in NYC are loyal Prelates of the Chancellor.</div> </div> </div> </div>LOL<br /> <br /> As I said about being a network engineer, at least the pay is good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T13:07:05-07:00","id":1061939,"title":"","content":"There are benefits to being on the winning side....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T14:52:27-07:00","id":1062005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061875#post1061875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, yeah - Pantechnicon are still active. Don't know where you got the impression they weren't.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind that I worked for a bank for five years, and then at a mobile phone provider for eight. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Everyone's a tool of the Seers in some way. It's the Lie for you.</div> </div> </div> </div>The comparison of the Lie to the complacency bred by a comfortable developed world existence strikes closer to home than usual. I'll be watching to see if the Pantechs show up again in future.<br /> <br /> I always assumed it died in the fires of the Great Refusal and finally stopped writhing in Europe's ashes following WWII. I don't recall it being mentioned in the Seers book, only the Mage Noir one, so it felt like a natural assumption that there's only one Ministry per Exarch.<br /> <br /> It raises the obvious question of just how many Ministries there are out there.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1061884#post1061884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh well the pay is good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seers One-Oh-Friggin'-One.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T15:18:19-07:00","id":1062014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1062005#post1062005\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't recall it being mentioned in the Seers book, only the Mage Noir one,</div> </div> </div> </div>They're mentioned in passing as the developers of the Leeching ATM Card imbued item.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T15:21:14-07:00","id":1062017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1062005#post1062005\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The comparison of the Lie to the complacency bred by a comfortable developed world existence strikes closer to home than usual.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think the Lie is necessarily one for one with the complacency bred by a comfortable developed world existence, given that the Lie is just as strong in the developing world as it is in the developed one, and has been throughout all of history (given that the Time Before never really happened.)<br /> <br /> It just so happens that said complacency is a really, really, really good tool for helping it along. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T17:24:27-07:00","id":1062083,"title":"","content":"I always assumed that the Seers controlled various bug corporations, government departments and such the same way that the Pentacle influence Mystery Cults.<br /> <br /> Like, the Seers aren't massive Silicon Valley tech companies for example. But they have inserted their ideas and symbols into said companies to ease access to them and influence over them when they need it. The Seer isn't on the Board of Directors, but they're a shady Consultant the board knows, who has been in all their heads and knows just how to pull their strings to change the odd policy, reinforce the Lie here and there, divert resources on occasion to other tasks etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/117-solar","name":"Solar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T17:26:56-07:00","id":1062085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1062083#post1062083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always assumed that the Seers controlled various bug corporations, government departments and such the same way that the Pentacle influence Mystery Cults.<br /> <br /> Like, the Seers aren't massive Silicon Valley tech companies for example. But they have inserted their ideas and symbols into said companies to ease access to them and influence over them when they need it. The Seer isn't on the Board of Directors, but they're a shady Consultant the board knows, who has been in all their heads and knows just how to pull their strings to change the odd policy, reinforce the Lie here and there, divert resources on occasion to other tasks etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there are Sleepwalkers on the Board of Directors who can see the truth and have been given wealth and power in exchange for cooperation, though. The Sleepwalkers have their place in the Iron Pyramid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T19:00:47-07:00","id":1062126,"title":"","content":"Now I wonder if E(vil) Corp from <b>Mr Robot </b>is more Mammon or Pantechnicon controlled...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FZuOFdHKtF8\" data-code=\"FZuOFdHKtF8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/FZuOFdHKtF8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T20:30:27-07:00","id":1062150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1062005#post1062005\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It raises the obvious question of just how many Ministries there are out there.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually, the Seers of the Throne book does state that there may be hundreds of Lesser Ministries out there spread all across the globe. The big difference between them and the most famous Lesser Ministries like Mammon and Pantechnicon are that they're usually either very regional in scope or very specific in their function. In reality, they might as well be thought off as just Nameless Orders loyal to the Exarchs who loosely follow the Ministry and Tetrerchy structure. Most don't even have archmasters as Ministers or Tetrarchs, and are only given a minor voice in the Tetrarchy because they provide a very niche service to the more global Ministries. <br /> <br /> The best example I can think of off the top of my head is the example of a Heretic Lesser Ministry from Left-Handed Path: The Cult of the Stone Whisper. Their entire purpose, their one job, was to oversee an imprisoned Bound and make sure nothing threatened it's prison seals and they ended up worshiping and serving it instead of their patron Exarch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Corrections: Wrong Book Name 03-13-2017, 11:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T22:33:43-07:00","id":1062178,"title":"","content":"Could've sworn I saw a Ministry of Pornography mentioned in one of the intro fic pieces somewhere. Or maybe I retconned it into my memory because it sounds like something a Lesser Ministry might tackle... btw, digging Dusksage's comparison of the Lesser Ministries to Nameless Orders (who happen to focus their collective praxes around the symbology of an Exarch in some fashion).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T23:31:08-07:00","id":1062190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1062178#post1062178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could've sworn I saw a Ministry of Pornography mentioned in one of the intro fic pieces somewhere. Or maybe I retconned it into my memory because it sounds like something a Lesser Ministry might tackle... btw, digging Dusksage's comparison of the Lesser Ministries to Nameless Orders (who happen to focus their collective praxes around the symbology of an Exarch in some fashion).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You're not retconning that. It's either an actual Lesser Ministry or just a made up one by that Th\u00e9arch protagonist in order to pass off as another Seer in the Sanctum &amp; Sigil opening fiction. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T23:34:22-07:00","id":1062192,"title":"","content":"A Lesser Ministry of <i>pornography</i>? I do wonder what form of control they promote. The Raptor, perhaps? (&quot;We are nothing but animals&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T06:20:23-07:00","id":1062259,"title":"","content":"That or a lesser aspect of The Eye, maybe? &quot;You want this, but don't let anyone catch you watching/reading it!&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And thanks for the reassurance that I'm not crazy, Dusksage. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T13:59:43-07:00","id":1062466,"title":"","content":"My money's on the Chancellor. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As much as I've heard the pronography industry is doing a lot better about presenting liberated sexuality and sexual expression as opposed to raw sexual objectification, the industry has such a long history of objectifying sex that if the Ministry does exist it probably would be yet another Lesser Ministry of the Chancellor.<br /> <br /> Still though, even if that one Th\u00e9arch did make it up on the spot, that fact that it worked in the story and has turned into a topical discussion now is absolutely hilarious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 03-14-2017, 05:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T15:52:36-07:00","id":1062516,"title":"","content":"A Ministry about pornography could also follow <a href=\"http://kingofthehill.wikidot.com/the-ruin\" target=\"_blank\">the Ruin</a>, <br /> <br /> &quot;Fate\u2019s Seal is the entropy that destroys dreams, relationships and even civilizations. Mystic destinies create new opportunities, but the Ruin ensures that people are skeptical and cynical about the opportunities ahead of them.&quot;<br /> <br /> That sure sounds a lot like most of the pornography industry. Rather than sexual liberation and pride, it represents destroyed dreams and exploitation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T17:11:22-07:00","id":1062560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RomulusGloriosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1061731-something-strange-about-pantechnicon?p=1062085#post1062085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think there are Sleepwalkers on the Board of Directors who can see the truth and have been given wealth and power in exchange for cooperation, though. The Sleepwalkers have their place in the Iron Pyramid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, me too. Seems to make a lot of sense, especially as to the Seers, magic is a bribe and a threat, and Sleepwalkers can more easily be shown the riches you can shower them with... and the horrors of what awaits those who betray the service of the Exarchs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/117-solar","name":"Solar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-15T10:52:24-07:00","id":1062862,"title":"","content":"This thread has left me pondering what other lesser Ministries or foci of oppression might exist out there that the Seers and their Exarchial cult brethren may exploit in earnest. Given the subject of the Pantechnicon, my thoughts have resided on the Father as a source of mangled anti-spiritualism and the rise of modern materialist thinking that is, in the Mage cosmology, objectively wrong. At the turn of the last century, Nietzsche predicted the future and it was a godless world that he saw; one where religion lost its power to sway and guide and grand but cruel ideologies would rule.<br /> <br /> From scientific (&quot;scientific&quot;) racism and sexism proclaiming it was right for one race or sex to rule over all others due to supposed demonstrable superiority, to the turning of the supernatural, so manifest a thing in the lives of all humans for eons, into something that admitting a public belief in outside of the most banal and mundane senses earned accusations of feebleness of mind, it is not hard to feel the hand of the Seers at work in reinforcing such institutions.<br /> <br /> Prime is the arcanum of Truth, after all, and nothing is so profoundly capable of producing ignorance as half a Truth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}